ly.\n\n   - Cross-document comparison ultimately requires aligning content\n     from BOTH documents. This usually means (a) extracting structured\n     section data per document, (b) aligning by section name or topic,\n     (c) computing per-section diffs.\n\n   - Behavior-tree primitives (sequence, parallel, map-each, llm, code,\n     final) are the durable observable record. Prefer emitting a tree\n     over coordinating multiple sub-calls inline as imperative Phase-1\n     Clojure code.", :success-policy nil, :timeout-ms nil, :reads [:contract-a-pages :contract-b-pages], :model "openai/gpt-5.4", :rlm {:debug? true, :sub-model "openai/gpt-5.1-chat"}}}, :root-node-id #uuid "89a8c3b6-0afe-41a4-8f4a-376a750580fd", :blackboard-entries {:contract-a-pages {:sheet-id #uuid "0a5a95f2-e7b0-43bc-aa6c-e4a5a5d326ba", :key :contract-a-pages, :schema [:vector :string], :value nil, :version 0}, :contract-b-pages {:sheet-id #uuid "0a5a95f2-e7b0-43bc-aa6c-e4a5a5d326ba", :key :contract-b-pages, :schema [:vector :string], :value nil, :version 0}, :report {:sheet-id #uuid "0a5a95f2-e7b0-43bc-aa6c-e4a5a5d326ba", :key :report, :schema :string, :value nil, :version 0}, :section-diffs {:sheet-id #uuid "0a5a95f2-e7b0-43bc-aa6c-e4a5a5d326ba", :key :section-diffs, :schema [:vector [:map-of :any :any]], :value nil, :version 0}, :key-differences {:sheet-id #uuid "0a5a95f2-e7b0-43bc-aa6c-e4a5a5d326ba", :key :key-differences, :schema [:vector [:map-of :any :any]], :value nil, :version 0}, :summary {:sheet-id #uuid "0a5a95f2-e7b0-43bc-aa6c-e4a5a5d326ba", :key :summary, :schema :string, :value nil, :version 0}}, :version-number nil}, :event/tags #{[:tick #uuid "27fa837f-8ce5-4d4e-a413-26d94d7b60e9"] [:sheet #uuid "0a5a95f2-e7b0-43bc-aa6c-e4a5a5d326ba"]}, :event/timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-21T16:42:44.974367-05:00", :inputs {:contract-a-pages ["       \n \nFEED-IN TARIFF MICROFIT CONTRACT \nVersion 2.0 \nPart 1 – Contract Details \n \nThe Ontario Power Authority (“OPA”) is offering 